Keeping the original idea, for further discussions - invisible to the average reader!


^   RavPower RP-WD009 OpenWrt Flash Layout  ^^^^^^^^^
^ Layer0 |  raw flash, 16384 KiB  ||||||||
^ Layer1 |  **mtd0** \\ ''u-boot'' \\ 192 KiB  |  **mtd1** \\ ''u-boot-env'' \\ 64 KiB  |  **mtd2** \\ ''factory'' \\ 64 KiB  |  **mtd3** \\ ''firmware'' \\ 16062 KiB <sub><sup>(= FlashSize-(192+64+64))</sup></sub>  |||||
^ Layer2 |:::|:::|:::|  **mtd4** \\ ''kernel'' \\ 1536KiB  |  **mtd5** \\ ''rootfs''  ||||
^ Layer3 |:::|:::|:::|:::                       |  **''/dev/root''** \\ around 2.3 MiB  |  **mtd6** \\ ''rootfs_data'' \\ around 12 MiB  |||

