==== OEM installation using the Recovery method ====

  - You need to use the 21.02.7 version for first flash. Download https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/21.02.7/targets/ramips/mt76x8/openwrt-21.02.7-ramips-mt76x8-ravpower_rp-wd009-squashfs-factory.bin to your computer.
  - On the RP-WD009, press the reset button and keep it pressed.
  - Power up the RP-WD009. Keep pressing the reset button for 10 more seconds until the Globe LED lights up.
  - Attach your Computer to the Ethernet port. Assign yourself the address 10.10.10.1/24.
  - Access the recovery page at ''%%http://10.10.10.128%%'' and upload the OpenWrt ''...factory.bin'' image.
  - The flashing will take around 1 minute. The device will reboot automatically into OpenWrt.
  - Advice, if you want to use the RP-WD009 as travelrouter: use the firmware-selector and build a custom image, adding these packages: luci-app-travelmate qrencode luci-mod-battstatus block-mount kmod-fs-vfat kmod-fs-ext4 f2fs-tools kmod-fs-f2fs e2fsprogs


